.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.obsidian/
.env

# Obsidian scratch — created by clicking around the vault, never content
*.canvas
*.base

# ── Local data is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT ──────────────────────────────────────
# This repo maps a machine and the repos on it. A blocklist made every new
# output file public by default and leaked twice: inventory/inventory.md, then
# churn.jsonl (which carries private repo and module names).
# Allowlist instead. Anything new under these paths stays local unless it is
# explicitly un-ignored below.
inventory/*
wiki/stacks/*
repos.txt

# Publishable exceptions, each one a deliberate decision:
!inventory/.gitkeep
!wiki/stacks/EXAMPLE.md
!repos.txt.example
.leakpatterns
!.leakpatterns.example
wiki/local/*
